/* HYDRA technical documentation overlay: Quick Fix subsystems of capability "validation".
   Four DIFFERENT subsystems are documented separately:
   (1) model Quick Fix (ActionModel runtime over the live model), (2) textual-model quick fix (grammar-driven text edits + canonical Quick Fix on textual sessions),
   (3) grammar code actions (edits on the grammar source itself), (4) transformation quick fixes (proposals over a TransformationDefinitionDocument). */
