          what: T("Interfaz sellada (sealed) base de las 10 clases de paso declarativo de una acción, serializada en JSON con el discriminador «kind».", "Sealed interface at the root of the 10 declarative step kinds of an action, serialised to JSON with the «kind» discriminator."),
          does: T("Declara permits exactamente SET_ATTRIBUTE, CLEAR_ATTRIBUTE, COPY_ATTRIBUTE, ADD_RELATION, REMOVE_RELATION, CREATE_ELEMENT, DELETE_ELEMENT, TRANSFORM_TEXT, EXECUTE_ACTION e INVOKE_OPERATION, y exige operationId() a cada una. Jackson usa @JsonTypeInfo/@JsonSubTypes para (de)serializar cada subtipo por su «kind».", "Permits exactly SET_ATTRIBUTE, CLEAR_ATTRIBUTE, COPY_ATTRIBUTE, ADD_RELATION, REMOVE_RELATION, CREATE_ELEMENT, DELETE_ELEMENT, TRANSFORM_TEXT, EXECUTE_ACTION and INVOKE_OPERATION, and requires operationId() on each. Jackson uses @JsonTypeInfo/@JsonSubTypes to (de)serialise each subtype by its «kind»."),
