          where: T("Edición de gramática → GrammarAnalysisService.analyze → ESTE analizador → GrammarAnalysisResult.codeActions → /code-actions → Monaco y panel de problemas.", "Grammar editing → GrammarAnalysisService.analyze → THIS analyzer → GrammarAnalysisResult.codeActions → /code-actions → Monaco and problems panel."),
